<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippines has deepened its security cooperation by signing a defence pact with Australia and hosting an ASEAN Maritime Center to boost regional maritime coordination, while also concluding free-trade talks with Canada. In Davao Region, authorities arrested 67 foreign nationals for alleged illegal activities, and former NPA rebels were redeployed as forest guards to protect the environment in Borongan. The Moro conflict context remains, with ongoing insurgent presence despite past peace deals. The UCDP recorded 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/15/australia-and-philippines-sign-new-defence-pact-amid-south-china-sea-tensions&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/14/canada-and-the-philippines-conclude-talks-on-free-trade-deal-mark-carney-says&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNLWtfU0tTallmSTNzSmZKOU9KVlRyalhxM1ZJaWphN3c0eHRIalJaUVNpWTdvTzRQWmZ4WHl6YW9qYmJwMUl1aDZIQlA3UGFBY21ka0xsbjNnWExMMWRJdzNkcFFjRnJpZVVoQmNLbm9xT0R0U2l0U3IzWlVEX3RENXNIQmJYWDQ0dnEyV2EzVFNVeS1rQWxMcTNuazVuODVtci02VmNvenFiSlg4em1PaWIwRkpkR0JH0gG-AUFVX3lxTE1XeVBEYmozamdmTXpQc2h1Tnp5TVZJeEU0dVVnQnd0VnRCc1dPU19FSHpjM0J1WjJVUWFLUE5SZjV5MzNnbks0R2Vmd3lXQTRsd1hLeTF2ZjdvTkNJZ1RwYi1UcGRhU09pZS0zVXlvN3NfaW92WEZ3MGdHWlJ6ek10TjZ1MzM2MzN5VXc4QlhuTXVhS0pyM0N6NmtfdTRubmkyamJabHBOVklVemM1S1dJUHZHUTYzZXpMd3k3X3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPYVRnb1lWR1JIeU1fbDU4aUdJdEI5Qmp2VUgwX0JQT1Y4TUNkNDdRSXhWbnhfcW9vRHA3Q2g5cnl0ZTFPeG0zMllieExDS0RpanlZUGlyWDVrYnB6blBNdURHUDc4RWxveGFvZWN3TWg0RThrNkJrb2dwSkd0OGxOY3c5WU13azlveHU0NmxkZHF2dkhoQ1lYV0NCRWdKUi1CMllDU3duQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href